        {
          "index": 0,
          "zh": "二年，高宗即位，拜中書侍郎。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "zh": "時上從人望，擢李綱為右相，綱將奏逐潛善及汪伯彥，右丞呂好問止之。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "zh": "未幾，潛善拜右僕射兼中書侍郎，綱遂罷。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "zh": "御史張所言潛善姦邪，恐害新政，左遷所尚書郎，尋謫江州。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "zh": "太學生陳東論李綱不可去，潛善、伯彥不可任，潛善恚。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "zh": "會歐陽澈上書詆時事，語侵宮掖，帝謂其言不實，潛善乘間啟殺澈並東誅之，識與不識皆為之垂涕，帝悔焉。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        }
      ]
